[{"answer":"We've got to choose a topic for our experiment, haven't we, Jack?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Were you thinking of something to do with seeds?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/2.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought we could look at seed germination - how a seed begins to grow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/4.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Any particular reason?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I know you're hoping to work in plant science eventually...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, but practically everything we do is going to feed into that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/8.mp3"},{"answer":"No, there's an optional module on seed structure and function in the third year that I might do,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/9.mp3"},{"answer":"so I thought it might be useful for that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/10.mp3"},{"answer":"If I choose that option, I don't have to do a dissertation module.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... well, I thought for this experiment we could look at the relationship between seed size and the way the seeds are planted.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/13.mp3"},{"answer":"So, we could plant different sized seeds in different ways, and see which grow best.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/14.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/15.mp3"},{"answer":"We'd need to allow time for the seeds to come up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/16.mp3"},{"answer":"That should be fine if we start now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/17.mp3"},{"answer":"A lot of the other possible experiments need quite a bit longer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/18.mp3"},{"answer":"So that'd make it a good one to choose.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/19.mp3"},{"answer":"And I don't suppose it'd need much equipment;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/20.mp3"},{"answer":"we're not doing chemical analysis or anything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Though that's not really an issue,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/22.mp3"},{"answer":"we've got plenty of equipment in the laboratory.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. We need to have a word with the tutor if we're going to go ahead with it though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure our aim's OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/25.mp3"},{"answer":"It's not very ambitious but the assignment's only 10% of our final mark, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/26.mp3"},{"answer":"But we need to be sure we're the only ones doing it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, it's only 5% actually,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/28.mp3"},{"answer":"but it'd be a bit boring if everyone was doing it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you read that book on seed germination on our reading list?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/30.mp3"},{"answer":"The one by Graves?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I looked through it for my last experiment,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/32.mp3"},{"answer":"though it wasn't all that relevant there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/33.mp3"},{"answer":"It would be for this experiment, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/34.mp3"},{"answer":"I found it quite hard to follow -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/35.mp3"},{"answer":"lots about the theory, which I hadn't expected","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I'd been hoping for something more practical.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/37.mp3"},{"answer":"It does include references to the recent findings on genetically-modified seeds, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that was interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I read an article about seed germination by Lee Hall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/40.mp3"},{"answer":"About seeds that lie in the ground for ages and only germinate after a fire?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/41.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/42-2025-01-16-13-50-02.mp3"},{"answer":"I knew a bit about it already, but not about this research.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/43.mp3"},{"answer":"His analysis of figures comparing the times of the fires and the proportion of seeds that germinated","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/44.mp3"},{"answer":"was done in a lot of detail - very impressive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Was that the article with the illustrations of early stages of plant development?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/46.mp3"},{"answer":"They were very clear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I think those diagrams were in another article.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, shall we have a look at the procedure for our experiment?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/49.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll need to get going with it quite soon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/51.mp3"},{"answer":"So the first thing we have to do is find our seeds.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/52.mp3"},{"answer":"I think vegetable seeds would be best.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/53.mp3"},{"answer":"And obviously they mustn't all be the same size.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/54.mp3"},{"answer":"So, how many sorts do we need?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/55.mp3"},{"answer":"About four different ones?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/56.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that would be enough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/57.mp3"},{"answer":"There'll be quite a large number of seeds for each one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Then, for each seed we need to find out how much it weighs,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/59.mp3"},{"answer":"and also measure its dimensions,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/60.mp3"},{"answer":"and we need to keep a careful record of all that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/61.mp3"},{"answer":"That'll be quite time-consuming.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/62.mp3"},{"answer":"And we also need to decide how deep we're going to plant the seeds -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/63.mp3"},{"answer":"right on the surface, a few millimetres down, or several centimetres.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/64.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/65.mp3"},{"answer":"So then we get planting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you think we can plant several seeds together in the same plant pot?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/67.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I think we need a different one for each seed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... Right. And we'll need to label them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/69.mp3"},{"answer":"We can use different coloured labels.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Then we wait for the seeds to germinate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/71.mp3"},{"answer":"I reckon that'll be about three weeks, depending on what the weather's like.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Then we see if our plants have come up, and write down how tall they've grown.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Then all we have to do is look at our numbers, and see if there's any relation between them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/74.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-3-2023-02-13-11-56-22/75.mp3"}]
